      "before": "<h1>关卡04&nbsp;</h1><h1><div></div></h1><h3><b>新一循环<span>醒来，严格按照以下步骤执行（时间紧张，需要2~3分钟全部完成）</span></b></h3><h1><div><span>1.出房间左拐第一个房间，前往RAFAEL的房间，打开电脑，密码MIRANDA（建议提前一循环解锁），解除安防措施；</span></div><div><div><span>2.量子电池插电；</span></div><div>3.从圆门去车库，关闭垃圾清理，拿到焚化炉钥匙；<br></div><div><span style=\"text-align: center;\">4.打开焚化炉，</span><span style=\"text-align: center\">拿到USB Key</span><br></div><div><span>5.直奔大厅电脑，使用USB Key，关闭电脑更新；</span></div><div>6.返回厨房机器人区域，电脑停止更新，<span>获取蓝图调节器</span><span>。</span></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/32514789788da0661df2da53410605e9a37ee09627a76a8dd4c8b85e462158d4.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>1.出房间左拐第一个房间，前往RAFAEL的房间，打开电脑，密码MIRANDA（建议提前一循环解锁），骇入防火墙2次，</span><span>解除安防措施</span><br></div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/323f91d7a6fc48ac9d370644c64316d74f0417b967a79b2c951688985f8fc804.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>2.量子电池插电</span><br></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/0bb2ad7d0a0217b50a44c91632dfa22cbb8b65f1c4445f5b78f7b9d3db24dcfe.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/0f4ffb916802474264e20a06e50240a17df1ebb67b3150c556e4bdf7e0cc23b9.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/577c78187412f75edf2e1d665a283c5a89454caf2af89fa18850d5586a252044.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>3.从圆门去车库，关闭垃圾清理，拿到焚化炉钥匙；</span><br></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/3bb2fdf28db2d9e050c93aa13953a6dc08c8abe0922220c8e256a11a4c103244.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">4.打开焚化炉，<span>拿到USB Key</span></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/af8c109194156bdf96e9ed51de4f0a4120d5947a5970ad63c51269cc62a3d4be.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>5.直奔大厅电脑，使用USB Key，关闭电脑更新；</span><br></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/352e05fb075991b7ba4d92732e84c4c0171ef55af34f3f8311132fee418a4d0c.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>6.返回厨房机器人区域，电脑停止更新，</span><span>获取蓝图调节器</span><span>。</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></h1>",
